    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36566" root="كبر" body-key="k">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكبرهُ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْبَارٌ</span>; (Msb;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استكبرهُ</span></b> ; (K;) <i>He deemed it great</i> [or
<i>formidable;</i> see an ex., voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَظِعَ</span>;] <i>it was great
in his estimation;</i> (IJ, K;) syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسْتَعْظَمَهُ</span>.
(S, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكبرت</span> <i>She brought forth a great
child,</i> or <i>young one.</i> (IKtt.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْغَرَتِ النَّاقَةُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَأَكْبَرَتْ</span>: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صغر</span>.

